### Java 代码实现
以下是完整的 Java 代码，包括并查集类和链表反转方法。代码考虑了边界条件（如空链表、单节点链表）。

```java
// 并查集类，用于检测链表中的环
class UnionFind {
    private int[] parent;
    private int[] rank;

    public UnionFind(int size) {
        parent = new int[size];
        rank = new int[size];
        for (int i = 0; i < size; i++) {
            parent[i] = i;
            rank[i] = 0;
        }
    }

    // 查找根节点，使用路径压缩
    public int find(int x) {
        if (parent[x] != x) {
            parent[x] = find(parent[x]);
        }
        return parent[x];
    }

    // 合并两个集合，使用按秩合并
    public void union(int x, int y) {
        int rootX = find(x);
        int rootY = find(y);
        if (rootX != rootY) {
            if (rank[rootX] < rank[rootY]) {
                parent[rootX] = rootY;
            } else if (rank[rootX] > rank[rootY]) {
                parent[rootY] = rootX;
            } else {
                parent[rootY] = rootX;
                rank[rootX]++;
            }
        }
    }

    // 检测两个节点是否在同一集合中
    public boolean isConnected(int x, int y) {
        return find(x) == find(y);
    }
}

// 链表节点类
class ListNode {
    int val;
    ListNode next;

    ListNode(int x) {
        val = x;
        next = null;
    }
}

// 链表类，包含反转方法
class LinkedList {
    private ListNode head;

    public LinkedList() {
        head = null;
    }

    // 添加节点到链表尾部
    public void addNode(int val) {
        ListNode newNode = new ListNode(val);
        if (head == null) {
            head = newNode;
        } else {
            ListNode current = head;
            while (current.next != null) {
                current = current.next;
            }
            current.next = newNode;
        }
    }

    // 使用并查集检测链表是否有环，并反转链表
    public ListNode reverseList() {
        // 边界条件：空链表或单节点链表
        if (head == null || head.next == null) {
            return head;
        }

        // 首先，检测链表是否有环
        int size = 0;
        ListNode current = head;
        while (current != null) {
            size++;
            current = current.next;
        }

        UnionFind uf = new UnionFind(size);
        current = head;
        int index = 0;
        boolean hasCycle = false;
        while (current != null) {
            if (index > 0) { // 从第二个节点开始检查
                ListNode temp = head;
                int tempIndex = 0;
                while (temp != current) {
                    if (uf.isConnected(index, tempIndex)) {
                        hasCycle = true;
                        break;
                    }
                    temp = temp.next;
                    tempIndex++;
                }
            }
            if (hasCycle) {
                break;
            }
            current = current.next;
            index++;
        }

        if (hasCycle) {
            System.out.println("链表存在环，无法反转。");
            return null;
